// Winning labeled hamming shared by the most kept pairs.
// A tie of counts returns the greater hamming.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hmode ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hmode rank

IMPULSE hmode 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hmode" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
